\
Important:\
\
Do not treat confidence, belief_mass, and uncertainty intervals as interchangeable.\
\
Choose a coherent mathematical interpretation.\
\
If Dempster-Shafer or imprecise probability is eventually implemented, represent its semantics explicitly rather than using a generic belief_mass field.\
\
